42
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, just off of this road
there's a nice town with a hot spring.</font>

43
00:01:41,410 --> 00:01:42,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yunosato Hot Springs...</font>

44
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They say it does a world of good
for fatigue and beauty.</font>

45
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't we going straight home?
Everyone's waiting!</font>

46
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's right.</font>

47
00:01:52,630 --> 00:01:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our hometown is in
a state of emergency,</font>

48
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no time to procrastinate.</font>

49
00:01:57,130 --> 00:02:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't make much difference
if we're one or two days late...</font>

50
00:02:02,810 --> 00:02:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really popular with girls,
and it's mixed bathing...</font>

51
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey?! Pervy Sage?</font>

52
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sometimes it's necessary for humans
to take breathers.</font>

53
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll take one bath!</font>

54
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not what you said before!</font>

55
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay. Well, let's go!</font>

56
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's her, no mistake.</font>

57
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've finally... found her.</font>

58
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:43,780
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Naruto's</font>

59
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:43,780
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Strange</font>

60
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:43,780
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Hot Springs Side Trip</font>

61
00:02:56,230 --> 00:02:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have the pleasure of
a visit from four people and one piglet.</font>

62
00:02:59,450 --> 00:03:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Welcome!
— Welcome!</font>

63
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though this has mixed bathing...</font>

64
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"good children should not copy him"</b></font>

65
00:03:09,210 --> 00:03:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm all alone with this brat.
I'm so unlucky.</font>

66
00:03:14,210 --> 00:03:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, shall we play pachinko
or something?</font>

67
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have plenty of time before dinner.</font>

68
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not going to the hot spring?</font>

69
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:24,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we go right now, there are fools...</font>

70
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, let's go, let's go.</font>

71
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get out already.</font>

72
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet, not yet.
Not until the girls get here.</font>

73
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see...</font>

74
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:46,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, c'mon girls.
All of you, come on...</font>

75
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

76
00:03:49,410 --> 00:03:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, that was refreshing.</font>

77
00:03:55,790 --> 00:03:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-We've been robbed!</font>

78
00:04:00,670 --> 00:04:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The necklace I got from
Grandma Tsunade is gone!</font>

79
00:04:04,340 --> 00:04:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where! Where is it?!</font>

80
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"If you want your necklace back,
give back the money"?</font>

81
00:04:12,270 --> 00:04:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"We'll wait at the three cedars on
the mountain behind."</font>

82
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Signed, the Akagi Family.</font>

83
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Money?</font>

84
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are they talking about?</font>

85
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Girls came in, all right.</font>

86
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

87
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:30,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're all female monkeys!</font>

88
00:04:33,370 --> 00:04:35,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to bathe with people.</font>

89
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, here I am!</font>

90
00:04:42,090 --> 00:04:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come out! Akagi Family!</font>

91
00:04:48,050 --> 00:04:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want, kid?!</font>

92
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:52,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my line!</font>

93
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't borrowed any money
from you people!</font>

94
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So give me my necklace back!</font>

95
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"My" necklace?</font>

96
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did we mistake his stuff
for that woman's?</font>

97
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, that's it!
Give it back!</font>

98
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait!</font>

99
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

100
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:10,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

101
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You thieves!</font>

102
00:05:14,370 --> 00:05:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Take this!
— Go!</font>

103
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Help...</font>

104
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People came, all right...</font>

105
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

106
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:28,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're all men!</font>

107
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Bring it on!
— Cheers!</font>

108
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to bathe with women...</font>

109
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? So the one who borrowed money
is Grandma Tsunade?</font>

110
00:05:40,110 --> 00:05:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... nicknamed
the "Legendary Sitting Duck".</font>

111
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She played at the Akagi gambling den
until she was penniless.</font>

112
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We loaned her what she lost.</font>

113
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, and there's an I.O.U.</font>

114
00:05:54,910 --> 00:05:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?! There are so many zeros!</font>

115
00:05:59,210 --> 00:06:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Senta, this guy is called Bunzo.</font>

116
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The boss ordered us to collect
on the debt three years ago...</font>

117
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:14,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We set out on a journey
from Akagi Mountain</font>

118
00:06:14,890 --> 00:06:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">prepared not to return
until we get the money back.</font>

119
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've heard rumors about
the lady here and there...</font>

120
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, she sure was something.</font>

121
00:06:24,570 --> 00:06:28,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was elusive and quite hard to find.</font>

122
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then recently, we caught
some information that she'd appeared.</font>

123
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were waiting on
the side of the road...</font>

124
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's when we came along
with Grandma Tsunade.</font>

125
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why did you raid the room
so stealthily?</font>

126
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rumor has it</font>

127
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that ordinary means don't work
against the "Legendary Sitting Duck."</font>

128
00:06:51,930 --> 00:06:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't think that
if we tried to collect amicably,</font>

129
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she would pay us.</font>

130
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's certainly stingy...</font>

131
00:06:58,100 --> 00:07:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We heard that she cherished the necklace
next to her life,</font>

132
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we thought she'd pay
in exchange for it.</font>

133
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way. After all, you raided my room.</font>

134
00:07:08,650 --> 00:07:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We never even dreamed that the owner
of the necklace would have changed...</font>

135
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Err... Can't you ask the lady to pay?</font>

136
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, even you say so...</font>

137
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please! If we don't get the money back,
we can't go home!</font>

138
00:07:26,210 --> 00:07:28,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our wives and kids are waiting for us
to come home!</font>

139
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:32,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Please... I'm begging you!
— Please... I'm begging you!</font>

140
00:07:39,180 --> 00:07:40,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all gone...</font>

141
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:44,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bad luck...
damn it. I'm stone broke.</font>

142
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's call it quits with pachinko.</font>

143
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time for a bath...</font>

144
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Shizune...
— Yes?</font>

145
00:07:50,110 --> 00:07:52,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My bag is at the front desk of the inn.</font>

146
00:07:52,570 --> 00:07:56,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!
Y-You can't mean to bring it here?!</font>

147
00:07:56,910 --> 00:07:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything to your name is in it...</font>

148
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've just lost! I can't repress this
feeling!</font>

149
00:08:04,170 --> 00:08:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just bring it without complaint.</font>

150
00:08:06,130 --> 00:08:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am!</font>

151
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Could you be...</font>

152
00:08:15,090 --> 00:08:17,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You are...!</font>

153
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are women, all right...</font>

154
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

155
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:34,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was hoping for younger,
more titillating women...</font>

156
00:08:36,660 --> 00:08:37,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one, right?</font>

157
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

158
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:41,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you with Ms Tsunade?</font>

159
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

160
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This came for her not long ago...</font>

161
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:48,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To Tsunade
A letter? I wonder who could've...?</font>

162
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! Tsunade-sama!</font>

163
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

164
00:08:57,970 --> 00:09:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Tsunade-sama!</font>

165
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's not here...</font>

166
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:07,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Tonton...</font>

167
00:09:07,810 --> 00:09:10,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know to search for
Tsunade-sama, right!</font>

168
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, impossible? Why?</font>

169
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:23,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! The smell of the sulfur
from the hot spring interferes...</font>

170
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, the only way
to search for her is on foot!</font>

171
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

172
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! Tsunade-sama!</font>

173
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! Tsunade-sama!</font>

174
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you!</font>

175
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have a problem!</font>

176
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

177
00:09:46,770 --> 00:09:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, what in the world should I do?</font>

178
00:09:49,730 --> 00:09:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

179
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want him returned unharmed,
please return all of the money you owe!</font>

180
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll wait by the three cedars on
the mountain behind. The Akagi Family</font>

181
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?
I have to help Naruto.</font>

182
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that, if it's discovered
that Tsunade-sama has a huge debt,</font>

183
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">talk of her installment as
the Fifth Hokage will probably end.</font>

184
00:10:12,210 --> 00:10:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, we have
to handle this by ourselves.</font>

185
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Tonton?</font>

186
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think it's going to work out well?</font>

187
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.</font>

188
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here she comes.</font>

189
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!</font>

190
00:10:35,690 --> 00:10:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

191
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know who we are, right?</font>

192
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:42,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the henchmen of the Akagi.</font>

193
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll make it brief.</font>

194
00:10:45,490 --> 00:10:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pay back your debt
in one lump sum.</font>

195
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or else...</font>

196
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his life is over!</font>

197
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Help me!</font>

198
00:10:56,670 --> 00:11:00,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever.
His life doesn't matter much to me.</font>

199
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:02,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh!
— What did you just say?!</font>

200
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, the money...</font>

201
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did it come to this?</font>

202
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't titillating,
this is just tight!</font>

203
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Drats! Let me have patience!</font>

204
00:11:26,370 --> 00:11:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you hear me?</font>

205
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter to me
what happens with his life.</font>

206
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... damn old hag!</font>

207
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was what I would have said,
until just a little bit ago, I think.</font>

208
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once I become the Hokage,
he'd be a precious subordinate.</font>

209
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't leave him in this mess.</font>

210
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade...</font>

211
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:52,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, this is all I've got.
Take it.</font>

212
00:11:57,650 --> 00:11:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me make sure of this.</font>

213
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mean it's paid off in full,
but that'll do it for the interest, right?</font>

214
00:12:16,210 --> 00:12:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fake!</font>

215
00:12:25,050 --> 00:12:26,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not going to pay
the money back?</font>

216
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's none of your business.</font>

217
00:12:28,930 --> 00:12:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys can't go home!
Don't you feel sorry for them!</font>

218
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You couldn't possibly?</font>

219
00:12:34,730 --> 00:12:37,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case, I'll have to use force
to get it back!</font>

220
00:12:40,690 --> 00:12:42,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's Shadow Clones?!</font>

221
00:12:43,570 --> 00:12:47,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, Naruto has joined hands
with the Akagi Family...</font>

222
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, where did Naruto and company go?</font>

223
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected...</font>

224
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think she'd hand
the money over meekly.</font>

225
00:12:56,670 --> 00:12:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to be that much of a coward...</font>

226
00:12:58,290 --> 00:12:59,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?</font>

227
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade has a huge suitcase.</font>

228
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doubt there's money in it.</font>

229
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to do something
to get our hands on that suitcase.</font>

230
00:13:17,650 --> 00:13:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot!</font>

231
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:22,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm supposed to be kidnapped,
and she's casually drinking alcohol.</font>

232
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:24,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's that suitcase.</font>

233
00:13:25,070 --> 00:13:26,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do we get it out?</font>

234
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me.</font>

235
00:13:33,500 --> 00:13:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, you've returned.</font>

236
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:40,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, here's the suitcase.</font>

237
00:13:40,090 --> 00:13:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dangerous,
so let's leave it at the front desk.</font>

238
00:13:43,210 --> 00:13:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then...</font>

239
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, I went and got it!</font>

240
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You did it!
— You did it!</font>

241
00:14:09,070 --> 00:14:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!</font>

242
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot... If you're the Hokage...</font>

243
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're the Hokage,</font>

244
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:20,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then pay your debt back
like a Hokage would!</font>

245
00:14:21,090 --> 00:14:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Hokage is meant
to protect everyone!</font>

246
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys can't return to their home,
they are desperate!</font>

247
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you do something?!</font>

248
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:30,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

249
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or do people from other countries
not matter to you?</font>

250
00:14:34,350 --> 00:14:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kind of Hokage...
I cannot accept!</font>

251
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

252
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:44,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

253
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and run away!</font>

254
00:14:46,650 --> 00:14:47,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Okay!</font>

255
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:01,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, she's already catching up!</font>

256
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all or nothing!</font>

257
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:07,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

258
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You did it!
— You did it!</font>

259
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tonton?!</font>

260
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

261
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just hand over the suitcase! Or else!</font>

262
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-Fork over the suitcase!</font>

263
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we take a direct hit from
Grandma Tsunade's attack,</font>

264
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it's over!</font>

265
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of the way, out of the way!</font>

266
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:33,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Purse snatchers?</font>

267
00:15:34,070 --> 00:15:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse us!</font>

268
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey what's going on?!</font>

269
00:15:36,330 --> 00:15:39,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Don't cause trouble
for the general public!</font>

270
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you're following us!</font>

271
00:15:45,090 --> 00:15:46,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

272
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

273
00:16:08,190 --> 00:16:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on...?</font>

274
00:16:10,190 --> 00:16:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, we leave it up to you.</font>

275
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no good.</font>

276
00:16:15,370 --> 00:16:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the contents of that suitcase
become known,</font>

277
00:16:21,710 --> 00:16:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, that happened too.</font>

278
00:16:24,330 --> 00:16:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I was young then too.</font>

279
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gulp it down.</font>

280
00:16:31,050 --> 00:16:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me, Boss.</font>

281
00:16:32,930 --> 00:16:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it? You're in front of a guest.</font>

282
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Well...</font>

283
00:16:48,150 --> 00:16:49,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A clone!</font>

284
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:56,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a clone too?</font>

285
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wrong again.</font>

286
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sheesh, which is the real one?!</font>

287
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:14,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rest...</font>

288
00:17:15,050 --> 00:17:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Where are the rest?!
— Where are the rest?!</font>

289
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

290
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hold it!
— Hold it!</font>

291
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto!
— Naruto!</font>

292
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wait!
— Wait!</font>

293
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto!
— Naruto!</font>

294
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself!</font>

295
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot, let me go! Let me go!</font>

296
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Settle down!</font>

297
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:14,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">G-Got it!</font>

298
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The money!</font>

299
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, they got it!</font>

300
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">IOU's?!</font>

301
00:18:24,910 --> 00:18:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not money?!</font>

302
00:18:27,410 --> 00:18:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh no...
— This is too much!</font>

303
00:18:30,170 --> 00:18:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!
This is in the middle of town!</font>

304
00:18:33,460 --> 00:18:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh!</font>

305
00:18:36,050 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Two Old Ladies?!</font>

306
00:18:40,090 --> 00:18:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mixed up in
this commotion as well?</font>

307
00:18:43,010 --> 00:18:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to hear your reason
for it, Shizune!</font>

308
00:18:48,190 --> 00:18:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hello... Tsunade-sama...</font>

309
00:18:50,810 --> 00:18:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Shizune...</font>

310
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you guys belong to the Akagi.</font>

311
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:57,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Boss Jirocho!</font>

312
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who?</font>

313
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know?!</font>

314
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the number one gang boss,
Jirocho from the Land of Tea!</font>

315
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:06,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an old friend of mine.</font>

316
00:19:07,250 --> 00:19:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As luck would have it,
we met by accident on the street.</font>

317
00:19:09,870 --> 00:19:12,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Bunzo and Senta
if I'm not mistaken.</font>

318
00:19:13,170 --> 00:19:15,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just in time.
I have something to say to you!</font>

319
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

320
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean the debt to the Akagi Family?</font>

321
00:19:23,010 --> 00:19:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I paid it back a year ago.</font>

322
00:19:25,810 --> 00:19:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true?</font>

323
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:30,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was last year,
when we were near Akagi's.</font>

324
00:19:30,770 --> 00:19:32,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you forget?</font>

325
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry.</font>

326
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

327
00:19:35,820 --> 00:19:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a circular from Akagi
addressed to me.</font>

328
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just read the part addressed to you.</font>

329
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:43,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Senta and Bunzo,</font>

330
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The debt is paid, come home soon."
Signed, Shugoro Akagi.</font>

331
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See?</font>

332
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've gotta be kidding.</font>

333
00:19:55,630 --> 00:19:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All that energy spent, for nothing.</font>

334
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:02,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Thank you for helping us.
— Thank you for helping us.</font>

335
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Now we can go home relieved.
— Now we can go home relieved.</font>

336
00:20:06,180 --> 00:20:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go in good spirits.</font>

337
00:20:08,470 --> 00:20:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You too, Naruto. Take care!
— You too, Naruto. Take care!</font>

338
00:20:11,890 --> 00:20:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, if the suitcase
doesn't have money in it,</font>

339
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why were you so serious
about getting it back?</font>

340
00:20:17,610 --> 00:20:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

341
00:20:18,730 --> 00:20:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the IOU's were discovered
by the people in the village,</font>

342
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they'll oppose Tsunade-sama's
installment as Hokage.</font>

343
00:20:27,830 --> 00:20:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You worry too much.</font>

344
00:20:30,370 --> 00:20:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage and the debt
are unrelated.</font>

345
00:20:32,620 --> 00:20:35,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that,
she said she returned the money,</font>

346
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so there's nothing to worry about.</font>

347
00:20:38,130 --> 00:20:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least the Akagi debt was...</font>

348
00:20:40,170 --> 00:20:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

349
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry, don't worry!</font>

350
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? We forgot something?</font>

351
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally, the time has come.</font>

352
00:20:59,230 --> 00:21:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Communal bathing with girls...</font>

353
00:21:01,780 --> 00:21:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Patience paid off...</font>

354
00:21:05,130 --> 00:21:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

355
00:21:05,130 --> 00:21:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

356
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:15,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

357
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:15,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

358
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:19,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

359
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:19,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

360
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

361
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

362
00:21:24,550 --> 00:21:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

363
00:21:24,550 --> 00:21:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

364
00:21:30,490 --> 00:21:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

365
00:21:30,490 --> 00:21:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

366
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

367
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

368
00:21:44,470 --> 00:21:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

369
00:21:44,470 --> 00:21:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

370
00:21:47,350 --> 00:21:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

371
00:21:47,350 --> 00:21:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

372
00:21:53,620 --> 00:21:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

373
00:21:53,620 --> 00:21:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

374
00:21:58,050 --> 00:22:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

375
00:21:58,050 --> 00:22:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

376
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:12,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

377
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:12,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

378
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

379
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

380
00:22:23,080 --> 00:22:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

381
00:22:23,080 --> 00:22:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

382
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

383
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

384
00:22:37,660 --> 00:22:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You're awesome,
Grandma Tsunade!</font>

385
00:22:39,170 --> 00:22:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Kakashi-sensei and Sasuke
are all right now!</font>

386
00:22:41,750 --> 00:22:43,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You can't rejoice yet.</font>

387
00:22:43,710 --> 00:22:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The current situation
in the village is serious.</font>

388
00:22:46,670 --> 00:22:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You're right.
I have to do my best,</font>

389
00:22:48,010 --> 00:22:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">And work hard for
the village as well.</font>

390
00:22:50,090 --> 00:22:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey! N-Naruto,
where do you think you're going?!</font>

391
00:22:52,390 --> 00:22:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I have to fill my stomach first!</font>

392
00:22:54,390 --> 00:22:57,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You have no sense of emergency...</font>

393
00:22:57,350 --> 00:23:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Tsunade's Announcement! Quit Being a Ninja."</font>

394
00:23:00,940 --> 00:23:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What is that supposed to mean?!</font>

